{"reviewId": "392372839_89yJeflOl", "review": {"abstract": "6～8个月之后价格触底，在价格触底之后，如果库存持续回落，那就说明价格低点有效；如果库存回升，则低点无效。价格低点3～4个月后库存触底，则库存周期明确触底。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "17 采访合集", "chapterUid": 22, "content": "想象一个果农（生产者） 卖苹果：\n\n· 量价齐跌（6-8个月前）：苹果卖不动，价格一直降，果农也不想摘了。市场死气沉沉。\n· 价格触底：苹果价格跌到1块钱，终于不跌了。但果农还是不敢摘（库存还在降），因为怕摘了又卖不掉。\n· 库存触底（3-4个月后）：价格已经涨到1.5块了，果农终于相信“真的涨了”，开始大量摘苹果（库存见底回升）。这时候周期才真正启动。\n\n库存周期的底部 = 价格触底的那一刻，不是库存触底的那一刻。\n\n比如现在的黄金，还在下跌趋势中，还没看到“价格触底”的信号。按照这个判断方法，你应该等：\n   · 出现“量价齐跌”后的缩量横盘\n   · 价格不再创新低\n   · 然后才是分批买入的时机", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "3860-3938", "createTime": 1780388020, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 22, "reviewId": "392372839_89yJeflOl", "userVid": 392372839, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "17 采访合集", "author": {"userVid": 392372839, "name": "好运常来", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0015-XzgFZEYwQiGhOC9FthLSh10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "好运常来", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "欢喜就好", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202512-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 11713039, "name": "all🌸camellia", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/JibXHYy8J8pUPYLOzRetEpjBHKAwJQQb3urBic5LIxaVZgia2Efk4Gh8D9mKQFqrXwpxs99KgtNAicwv6HVYkOKxaicrrPUBjWkhe81mjN3kytdU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy"